2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Adolph Christoff Gabriel Sager was bon on 17 November 1771 in Oertzenhof (Poel), Mecklenburg, son of Carl Sager and Anna Dorothea Regina Schliemann. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 4 November 1802 in Lübeck, he married Christina Dorothea Dircks, daughter of Ludolph David Dircks and Dorothea Katharina Peters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Christina Dorothea died on 12 March 1844 in Lübeck. Adolph Christoff Gabriel died there on 30 March 1852.
