2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Emilie Sager was born on 14 February 1805 in Lübeck, the daughter of Adolph Christoff Gabriel Sager and Christina Dorothea Dircks. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 30 November 1826 in Lübeck, Emilie married Friedrich Asschenfeldt, the son of Gerhard Johann Asschenfeldt and Anna Margaretha Hedwig Eckmann. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Friedrich died on 15 September 1856 in Lübeck. Emilie died there on 21 November 1871.
