1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daniel Conrad Delius withdrew from family farm in Berenkämpen Vlotho and founded a textile company in Versmold, which is specialized on canvas. His brother, Johann Caspar Delius founded the company's branch in Biel
2 CONC efeld. As early as 1729 Daniel Conrad Delius was the mayor of Versmold, followed by Daniel Albrecht (1745-1798) and Johann Daniel Delius (1772-1837). The Delius family founded several trading houses in Versmold, one of whom was Wi
2 CONC lhelm Conrad Delius & Co., the most important.
2 CONT
