2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Margot Lütgens was born on 8 September 1885 in Hamburg, the daughter of George Henry Lütgens and Rosalie Lüdemann. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 27 October 1906 in Hamburg, Margot married Gustav Asschenfeldt, the son of Julius Asschenfeldt and Mathilde Kellinghusen. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Margot died on 17 April 1968 in Hamburg. Gustav died there on 25 February 1970.
