1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00646880&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Kuno Asschenfeldt was born on 8 October 1908 in Hamburg, the son of Gustav Asschenfeldt and Margot Lütgens. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Kuno studied law in Heidelberg, Genève and Hamburg. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 17 December 1936 in Oldeani, Tanganyika (now Tanzania), Kuno married Edith-Marie Lehmann-von Schreiber, daughter of Georg von Schreiber and Adelaide Frohne. They became the parents of five sons. 
2 CONT
2 CONT From 1940 Kuno was a planter at 'Neu-Viezen' in Oldeani, which later was confiscated.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://billiongraves.com/grave/Kuno-Asschenfeld/38119933?referrer=myheritage BillionGraves] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Feb 1 2024, 1:17:17 UTC''
