1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Niels Christian Ditlev Hjalmar de Bang''' was born on June 5, 1847 in Sparresholm, Toksværd Sogn, Toksværd, Naestved Municipality, Region Zealand, Denmark and was baptized on July 17, 1847 in Toksværd Kirke, Toksværd, Naestved 
2 CONC Municipality, Region Zealand, Denmark. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34635696078 Oluf Henrich Niels de Bang, til Haraldskær og Sparresholm] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-28461285 Marie Hedevig (Thørche) de Ban
2 CONC g]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Niels Christian Ditlev Hjalmar married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34670185083 Karen Ragnhild (von Arenstorff) de Bang] in 1878. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1879 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34670192003 Henriette Charlotte Juliane Marie de Bang];
2 CONT * 1881 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34670192317 Oluf Henrik Johannes de Bang];
2 CONT * 1883 [https://www.geni.com/profile-34670193024 Harald de Bang]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on March 10, 1918 in Mølholm, Vinding Sogn, Vinding, Vejle Municipality, Region Syddanmark, Denmark and was buried on March 17, 1918 in Toksværd kirkegård, Toksværd, Naestved Municipality, Region Zealand, Denmark. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ---- Niels Christian Ditlev Hjalmar de Bang is listed on page 23 of "Danmark's Adel Aarbog" https://archive.org/details/danmarksadelaarb1900kj/page/66
