1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Cai von Rantzau, Kletkamp''' was born circa 1488. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-103056000 Henrik Breidesen Rantzau] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-28931791 Øllegaard Ditlevsdatter von Buchwald]. He was a Amt
2 CONC mand (Rendsborg). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Cai married [https://www.geni.com/profile-31826816 Ida Hansdatter Blome] in 1511. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836490 Drude Rantzau, +]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-124063118 Magdalen
2 CONC e Caisdatter Rantzau]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-31828564 Anna Caisdatter von Rantzau]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-31830235 Margarethe Caisdatter Rantzow von de Klethkamp]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-74044388 Moritz Rant
2 CONC zau]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-31826796 Abel Caisdatter Rantzau]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-31824270 Ditlev Rantzau]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-31828090 Povl Rantzau]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died circa 1561. 
2 CONT ----
