2 CONT '''Margarethe Caisdatter Rantzow von de Klethkamp''' was born in 1526. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-31826806 Cai von Rantzau, Kletkamp] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-31826816 Ida Hansdatter Blome]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Margarethe married [https://www.geni.com/profile-31830117 Asmus Von Rumohr]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-31827441 Detlef Asmussen von Rumohr, til Søbogaard]; [https://www.geni.com/profil
2 CONC e-31825333 Cai Asmussen Rumohr]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-31828368 Magdalene Rumohr]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-31822990 Henneke von Rumohr]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-31830003 Ida Rumohr]; [https://www.geni.com/profi
2 CONC le-31839659 Henrik Rumohr]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on January 1, 1600 in Tøstrup. 
