2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Cai Asmussen Rumohr''' was born on June 11, 1566. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-31830117 Asmus Von Rumohr] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-31830235 Margarethe Caisdatter Rantzow von de Klethkamp]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Cai married [https://www.geni.com/profile-31825335 Elisabeth Ottosdatter von Rantzau] circa 1595. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-31825583 Dorothea Rumohr]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-702
2 CONC 74833 Henrik von Rumohr, til Roest og Tøstrup]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-31825659 Magdalene Rumohr, af Röst]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-31825238 Elisabeth Rumohr]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-31844648 Hedevig von Rumohr
2 CONC ]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34631334300 Margrethe Rumohr]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1625. 
2 CONT ----
