1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Elisabeth Sophie Friis''' was born on May 1, 1714 in København, Hof-og Slot, Sokkelund, Københavns amt. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-114034977 Christian Friis-Frijsenborg, til Grevskabet Frijsenborg] and [http
2 CONC s://www.geni.com/profile-114035279 Øllegaard von Gersdorff]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Sophie married [https://www.geni.com/profile-31826512 Jean Henri Desmercieres] on July 25, 1751 in Frijsenborg (Hammel kirke). 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on June 18, 1799 in København. 
2 CONT ----
