1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Clarelia Reventlow''' was born in 1573. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-31828084 Ditlev Ivensen Reventlow] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-75793713 Anna Pogwisch]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Clarelia married [https://www.geni.com/profile-70693025 Detlev von Ahlefeldt]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34706446139 Catharina von Ahlefeldt]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-31825074 Bendix von Ahlefeldt]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-122380007 Anna von von Ahlefeldt (Ahlefeldt)]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-31834887 Ditlev von Ahlefeldt (Ahlefeldt)]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34706446116 Clarelia von von Blome (von Ahlefeldt)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1598. 
2 CONT ----
