1 NAME Hélène Sophie Emilie (Jelka*) /Rosen/
2 GIVN Hélène Sophie Emilie (Jelka*)
2 SURN Rosen
2 _MARNM Delius
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 CITY Limpsfield
3 STAE England
