2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Henrik von Rumohr, til Roest og Tøstrup''' was born in 1600. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-31825333 Cai Asmussen Rumohr] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-31825335 Elisabeth Ottosdatter von Rantzau]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Henrik married [https://www.geni.com/profile-70274848 Ida Ditlevsdatter Brockdorff, af Vindeby Gods]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-31828186 Wilhelm Rumohr]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-
2 CONC 31844308 Magdalene von Rumohr]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-66412724 Margrethe von Rumohr]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-121643238 Cai Rumohr]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-126188284 Ditlev von Rumohr]; [https://www.geni.com/p
2 CONC rofile-8724540293 Augusta Elisabeth Henriksdatter Rumohr, af huset Roest og til Svanholm Gods]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34630874819 Anna Rumohr]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34630874725 Dorothea von Rumohr]; [https://www.g
2 CONC eni.com/profile-121095794 Frederik Rumohr]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-126189371 Ida Hedevig Henriksdatter Rumohr]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on February 2, 1653. 
2 CONT ----
